  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-02-22T12:25:34.632Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Something that would be neat to have is Customizable Status's. As of now, we have 3 options Available. Active, Join Me, And Busy. These are helpful, bat are limited. I Suggest adding an option for 2 or 3 more customizable status's. Well what do i mean by that? Well, Currently these profiles change settings and notification preferences. Active is your standard profile with default settings, join me is similar but has invite requests set to auto accept, and busy does not show invites, or invite requests. So what can VRChat do to make this better? Options. \nCustom profiles\nExample attached\nLets get this added!",
